>>
Rule 1 (input tensor must be valid for CELU activation)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 2 (alpha parameter should not be zero)
{v_1 : float} |= v_1 ≠ 0
>>
Rule 3 (alpha must be positive)
{v_1 : float} |= v_1 > 0
>>
Rule 4 (inplace parameter must be boolean)
{v_1 : bool} |= v_1 = true ∨ v_1 = false
>>
Rule 7 (alpha must be a float or int)
{v_1 : float ⊎ int} |= v_1 ≠ 0
>>
Rule 9 (input tensor should be compatible with alpha)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : float} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2)
